WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
Two bombs are lit beside the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.050
The backdash makes the recorded throw attempt miss.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.750
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.350
Light Vagabond Edge hits before the bomb launch.

5
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.750
Crouching medium kick intentionally whiffs during the bomb conversion.

6
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.450
The first heavy-punch teleport repositions Kimberly.

7
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.050
Crouching heavy punch extends the juggle.

8
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.100
The second heavy-punch teleport crosses the bomb-covered space.

9
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.200
The next crouching-heavy pickup leads into Sprint launcher.

10
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.650
Heavy bomb plant spends the last spray can.
